# DOCUMENTATION STANDARD

Documentation must describe the current intended behavior.

When behavior changes:
- update the relevant Feature Spec;
- update API documentation if the contract changes;
- update architecture documentation if architecture changes;
- update README/setup documentation when developer workflow changes.

Do not create duplicate documentation when an existing document should be updated.

Documentation should be concise, factual and maintainable.
